DISTRIBUTION

You may distribute Extensions built using this API only through the following
approved channels:

  a. The official Aether Gallery, subject to the review and approval process
     described at https://github.com/Aether-Launcher/Aether-Extensions.
  b. Any other distribution channel explicitly approved in writing by Aether.

Before any Extension may be distributed through the Gallery, it must be
submitted to Aether for review. Aether reserves the right to approve, reject,
or remove any Extension from the Gallery at its sole discretion, including for
reasons of security, quality, policy compliance, or user safety.

Extensions may be closed-source. You are not required to publish your
Extension's source code. However, Aether reserves the right to require source
access or a binary audit as part of the review process for any Extension.

RESTRICTIONS

You may not:

  1. Use the API to build a product that competes with Aether (including any
