  2. Distribute the API itself, or a modified version of it, as a standalone
     product or as part of another SDK or framework.
  3. Sublicense or transfer your rights under this license to any third party
     without prior written consent from Aether.
  4. Remove or alter any copyright, trademark, or attribution notices in the API.
  5. Use the Aether name, logo, or trademarks to imply endorsement of your
